# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Personal overrides — copy to .env.local (gitignored).
#
# You usually do NOT need this file. The committed defaults live in:
#   .env.development   → `next dev`   (UI 3100, API 8081)
#   .env.production    → `next build` (UI 3200, API 8082)
#
# .env.local outranks BOTH of those in every environment except test,
# so only set a key here when you deliberately want to override it —
# pointing the dev UI at a deployed API, for example.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined at build time; restart or rebuild after editing.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8081
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3100
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_NAME=Learna
